[7m Manual page tar(1) line 28 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K[1mDESCRIPTION[0m[m
[7m Manual page tar(1) line 29 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K       GNU [1mtar[0m is an archiving program designed to store multiple files in a single file (an  [1mar‐[0m[m
