[7m Manual page tar(1) line 77 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K[m
[7m Manual page tar(1) line 78 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K       The options in all three styles can be intermixed, although doing so with old  options  is[m
[7m Manual page tar(1) line 79 (press h for help or q to quit)[27m[K[K       not encouraged.[m
